%% Native Runtime 是进程内生命周期内核，不是独立分布式调度服务
flowchart TD
  SESSION[Session
会话作用域] --> RUN[AgentRun
持久化运行记录]
  RUN --> JOB[Native Runtime Job
进程内控制句柄]
  JOB --> Q[queued]
  Q --> R[running]
  R --> WAIT[waiting_approval / paused]
  WAIT -->|resume| R
  R --> DONE[completed]
  R --> FAIL[failed]
  R --> CANCEL[cancelled]
  JOB -.事件流 / 进度 / 取消.-> STORE[RunStore]
  STORE --> SQL[(SQLite
运行摘要与事件)]
